Qt
--
The editor uses the Qt framework (https://www.qt.io), version 6.12.1, under the GNU Lesser General Public License
version 3 (third_party/licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt, which refers to third_party/licenses/GPL-3.0.txt). Qt is linked
dynamically and shipped unmodified, as the official binaries from download.qt.io (tools/qt-pins.cmake names each
archive and its SHA-1). You may replace the Qt libraries in an installed copy with your own build of the same Qt
version. The editor's own source code is in this repository.

The source code of the Qt 6.12.1 modules shipped with the editor:

    https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/6.12/6.12.1/submodules/qtbase-everywhere-src-6.12.1.tar.xz
    https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/6.12/6.12.1/submodules/qtdeclarative-everywhere-src-6.12.1.tar.xz
    https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/6.12/6.12.1/submodules/qtsvg-everywhere-src-6.12.1.tar.xz
